    name: "M B.",
    rating: 5,
    text: "We would highly recommend Remick Lackey at Birdcreek Roofing. Him and his crew went above and beyond with our new roof installation and cleanup. They even had someone come out after the job was done to go back through and clean up any nails that could have been missed. Remick was very knowledgeable and helpful throughout the entire process, including dealing with our insurance. We are very pleased with the whole process and our roof looks great. It's rare to find someone who is willing and ready to help. We really appreciate all the hard work Remick and his crew did for us. Can't say enough good things about this business!",
