    date: "2022-08-23",
    id: 92,
    name: "Tina L.",
    rating: 5,
    text: "Chris Hulsey restored my faith in roofing contractors. Before my neighbor recommended Chris, I used another contactor who submitted photos to my insurance company. My claim was denied. After consulting with Chris, I discovered his knowledge and understanding of the business and claims process was above and beyond any other contractor I had consulted. He explained that the previous contractor had not climbed to the top of my very steep roof where Chris discovered more substantial damage and took the photos to prove it. This prompted my insurance adjuster to reopen my claim and send out another adjuster. Chris met with the adjuster to make sure she climbed to the difficult areas on my roof to examine the damage. Thanks to his efforts, the insurance company agreed to replace my roof. Chris closely supervised the entire process and made sure that his crew protected my landscaping and cleaned up after the job was done. The roof looks excellent, and Chris made the process painless. I highly recommend using Chris and Birdcreek Roofing.",
